WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:03.655
By the end of this module you should be able to
build a cleaning workflow

00:00:03.682 --> 00:00:09.842
rather than a one-off fix You should be able to
profile quality problems normalize

00:00:09.868 --> 00:00:15.710
representation validate rules identify duplicates
and use safer SQL patterns for changes

00:00:17.463 --> 00:00:21.094
You should also be able to explain what your
cleaning logic knows and what it

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:21.871
does not know
